WEBVTT

00:03.730 --> 00:06.930
It's... so... heavy!

00:08.810 --> 00:10.260
Come on, Sensei!

00:10.260 --> 00:12.080
Can't you walk on your own two legs?!

00:13.570 --> 00:15.780
<b>There was no
 response.</b>

00:16.120 --> 00:18.670
Huh? He's not actually dead, is he?

00:19.620 --> 00:21.580
<b>m 0 0 l 105 0 105 130 0 130</b>

00:19.620 --> 00:21.580
<b>Sensei
Profession: Adventurer
Sex: Male


LV           3
HP          1
MP          0

Poison
(Calmotin)</b>

00:20.150 --> 00:21.570
He's fine.

00:21.860 --> 00:24.530
He's simply resting in peace.

00:24.530 --> 00:27.740
Could you not say that in front of a coffin?

00:28.140 --> 00:30.160
We're nearly at the castle.

00:30.160 --> 00:31.500
Let us go, Tama.

00:31.500 --> 00:33.300
My name isn't Tama!

00:47.060 --> 00:51.660
<i>I swear I'll find you, Sacchan.</i>

00:52.610 --> 00:55.090
<i>Then we'll commit double-suicide together.</i>

02:18.950 --> 02:22.450
<b>No Longer Allowed               in Another World</b>

02:22.450 --> 02:23.750
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

02:23.750 --> 02:27.000
<b>[ No Longer Allowed               in Another World ]</b>

02:27.610 --> 02:30.640
Hey! We're here, Sensei!

02:48.770 --> 02:50.980
<b>Castle Town of Roth</b>

02:49.780 --> 02:54.240
I see. Another world, eh?

02:55.370 --> 02:56.700
Not bad.

02:57.710 --> 03:01.220
For now, let us go to the castle and 
have an audience with the king.

03:03.510 --> 03:05.400
What is this doing here?

03:04.520 --> 03:06.420
Where did it come from?

03:06.990 --> 03:10.960
<b>Castle Roth</b>

03:07.870 --> 03:10.970
Welcome, travelers.

03:10.960 --> 03:16.920
<b>King of Roth</b>

03:10.960 --> 03:16.920
<b>Thomas</b>

03:10.960 --> 03:16.920
<b>Princess            Charlotte</b>

03:10.970 --> 03:14.940
I am Thomas, the King of Roth.

03:14.940 --> 03:16.910
And I am Princess Charlotte.

03:16.910 --> 03:19.330
You must be exhausted 
from your long journey.

03:19.330 --> 03:22.060
Tonight you shall rest in 
the castle's bedchambers.

03:22.060 --> 03:24.360
What a generous king!

03:24.360 --> 03:26.130
We appreciate your consideration.

03:26.130 --> 03:29.390
But wait! There is a condition.

03:29.390 --> 03:33.530
I love hearing travelers' 
stories more than anything.

03:33.780 --> 03:39.540
Will you share one of your pleasant 
memories from your travels with me?

03:42.010 --> 03:46.040
In that case, shall I tell you how 
it feels to sleep in a coffin?

03:46.040 --> 03:47.450
What?!

03:47.740 --> 03:51.420
<i>Wait... Did he just threaten me?</i>

03:51.420 --> 03:53.660
B-By the way, King Thomas,

03:53.930 --> 03:57.430
Princess Charlotte is rather beautiful.

03:57.430 --> 04:00.590
Ah, yes. Isn't she?

04:00.590 --> 04:03.730
She's actually getting married soon.

04:03.730 --> 04:08.500
Since you're here, perhaps 
I'll ask for your advice.

04:09.760 --> 04:11.850
Bring them here.

04:11.850 --> 04:12.770
Yes, Your Majesty!

04:25.410 --> 04:27.070
Allow me to introduce you.

04:27.070 --> 04:29.790
<b>Warrior                 Gomez</b>

04:27.510 --> 04:32.750
This is Gomez, the valiant warrior, 
and Otto, the wandering minstrel of love.

04:29.790 --> 04:32.750
<b>Wandering Minstrel</b>

04:29.790 --> 04:32.750
<b>Otto</b>

04:33.560 --> 04:37.470
Perhaps due to the influence 
of the Wrathful Dark Lord,

04:37.470 --> 04:40.030
monster activity has increased recently.

04:40.030 --> 04:45.210
However, I've grown too old 
to deal with this problem.

04:45.800 --> 04:50.100
So I've decided that one 
of these two shall become

04:50.100 --> 04:52.970
Charlotte's husband and the next king.

04:53.480 --> 04:59.230
However, Charlotte has still 
not chosen a husband.

04:59.570 --> 05:00.880
My, my.

05:00.880 --> 05:04.990
So, travelers, I ask for your advice.

05:05.830 --> 05:09.240
Will it be Gomez the fighter 
or Otto the lover?

05:09.240 --> 05:13.440
Who is the more suitable 
husband for Charlotte?

05:13.450 --> 05:19.500
<b>Gomez

Otto</b>

05:19.490 --> 05:20.970
How should I know?

05:19.500 --> 05:22.500
<b>Otto</b>

05:19.500 --> 05:22.500
<b>m 0 0 l 80 0 80 30 0 30</b>

05:19.500 --> 05:22.500
<b>How should
I know?</b>

05:20.970 --> 05:22.130
What?!

05:22.870 --> 05:26.030
Your daughter's future hinges on 
this critical choice, doesn't it?

05:26.500 --> 05:30.010
It's not a question you should be asking 
travelers who just arrived today.

05:30.790 --> 05:35.270
You're a horrible tyrant of a king.

05:35.910 --> 05:36.820
No...

05:38.260 --> 05:40.340
You're not fit to be a king.

05:43.400 --> 05:49.060
That said, as one who is not fit to live 
in any world, I have no right to say that.

05:50.380 --> 05:52.710
I-I'm terribly sorry!

05:52.710 --> 05:56.340
Sensei is an Other Worlder, 
so he can be a bit... you know!

05:56.340 --> 06:00.300
It matters not. If he's an Other 
Worlder, then he cannot help it.

06:00.300 --> 06:03.250
I'm truly sorry!

06:03.250 --> 06:05.810
Truly! Truly!

06:03.570 --> 06:06.790
Sorry! Sorry!

06:06.200 --> 06:09.000
I'm sorry!

06:07.140 --> 06:09.000
Sorry!

06:18.960 --> 06:21.970
U-Um, Sensei?

06:23.990 --> 06:26.310
Are you having trouble sleeping?

06:31.830 --> 06:34.230
I never sleep well.

06:43.150 --> 06:45.720
S-Sensei...

06:46.510 --> 06:50.130
Who is Sacchan, exactly?

07:05.200 --> 07:07.020
You're shameless!

07:07.450 --> 07:10.560
How could you rest your head 
on a gentleman's thighs?!

07:10.560 --> 07:13.000
I was cold! What was I supposed to do?!

07:13.000 --> 07:13.980
It's what my species does!

07:13.980 --> 07:16.190
Regardless, I cannot overlook this!

07:16.190 --> 07:17.860
It's none of your business!

07:17.860 --> 07:19.470
In fact, you're just jealous, aren't you?

07:19.470 --> 07:20.540
My word!

07:20.540 --> 07:21.980
This is what you get!

07:21.980 --> 07:24.370
Not my tail!

07:22.810 --> 07:24.930
Too bad! This is what you get!

07:50.050 --> 07:52.020
It's a nice view.

07:54.360 --> 07:56.360
Traveler.

08:00.590 --> 08:02.970
It's a beautiful lake, isn't it?

08:04.480 --> 08:07.040
Indeed. It's beautiful.

08:08.350 --> 08:10.900
It makes me want to drown myself.

08:10.900 --> 08:11.880
What?!

08:12.210 --> 08:14.670
D-Drown yourself?

08:14.670 --> 08:17.380
Are you so troubled that you 
wish to kill yourself?

08:20.050 --> 08:23.180
It seems to me you are more troubled than I.

08:35.890 --> 08:40.670
I still can't choose between 
Mr. Gomez and Otto.

08:41.750 --> 08:44.780
It hasn't been long since 
Mr. Gomez arrived at the castle,

08:44.780 --> 08:48.750
but already he's the most 
dependable of our soldiers.

08:49.310 --> 08:53.100
My father has faith in his strength, as well.

08:53.100 --> 08:55.730
For that reason, I should 
probably choose him.

08:56.720 --> 09:00.270
But Otto is my childhood friend.

09:00.770 --> 09:06.590
Whenever I felt down, he wrote songs 
and came to sing them to me.

09:08.210 --> 09:11.580
What should I do?

09:17.830 --> 09:23.900
Unlike me, you are a truly kind 
girl who cares for her father.

09:24.620 --> 09:27.860
My life has been a continuous 
series of troubles.

09:28.630 --> 09:32.330
I've attempted suicide and 
double-suicide numerous times,

09:32.330 --> 09:36.170
inconveniencing my father 
and family greatly.

09:37.640 --> 09:38.870
But...

09:40.840 --> 09:46.280
I've never once asked anyone else 
to choose how I should live for me.

09:50.870 --> 09:56.440
You should decide for 
yourself what you will do.

09:57.650 --> 10:01.160
What is it that you truly want?

10:01.610 --> 10:05.690
Ask yourself that question.

10:13.500 --> 10:17.680
Travelers, I apologize for 
making you return here again.

10:17.680 --> 10:19.840
I have summoned you here for one reason.

10:19.840 --> 10:24.320
Charlotte has finally chosen 
who she will marry.

10:24.320 --> 10:28.030
I ask that you act as witnesses.

10:28.480 --> 10:31.870
When you consider the kingdom's future, 
I'm sure she will marry Mr. Gomez.

10:31.870 --> 10:35.160
I think she and Otto are the better match.

10:35.700 --> 10:36.770
What?

10:36.770 --> 10:42.400
Charlotte, stand before the man 
you've chosen and speak your vows.

10:43.140 --> 10:45.260
Yes, Father.

10:57.610 --> 11:00.570
I asked myself numerous times what I wanted...

11:03.200 --> 11:04.980
And I have made my decision.

11:06.300 --> 11:10.210
I shall commit double-suicide with this man.

11:12.300 --> 11:14.310
What?!

11:15.360 --> 11:19.250
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:15.870 --> 11:19.250
Shall I Tell You
How It Feels to
Sleep in a Coffin?

11:19.250 --> 11:20.080
Shall I Tell You
How It Feels to
Sleep in a Coffin?

11:19.250 --> 11:20.120
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:20.080 --> 11:20.120
Shall I Tell You
How It Feels to
Sleep in a Coffin?

11:20.120 --> 11:20.160
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:20.120 --> 11:20.160
Shall I Tell You
How It Feels to
Sleep in a Coffin?

11:20.170 --> 11:20.210
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:20.210 --> 11:20.290
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:20.290 --> 11:20.330
<b>No Longer Allowed in Another World</b>

11:22.720 --> 11:23.450
Double...

11:23.450 --> 11:24.420
Double...

11:24.420 --> 11:25.360
Double...

11:25.360 --> 11:27.330
Double-suicide?!

11:27.330 --> 11:29.530
Wh-What are you saying?!

11:29.810 --> 11:30.790
There is no god!

11:30.790 --> 11:31.880
Huh?!

11:32.800 --> 11:37.180
Traveler, after speaking to 
you, I thought all night.

11:37.180 --> 11:39.060
Then I realized something.

11:39.590 --> 11:45.290
Whenever I felt down, Otto wrote 
songs and came to sing them to me.

11:46.310 --> 11:51.140
But when I thought about it, I realized 
he also came when I didn't feel down.

11:52.150 --> 11:54.830
He made a ruckus all night last night, as well.

11:56.230 --> 12:00.890
I believe he simply wanted to perform 
his newest songs to someone.

12:02.160 --> 12:04.190
Also, I cannot marry Mr. Gomez.

12:04.910 --> 12:06.400
He smells a bit.

12:07.170 --> 12:09.130
Wait a minute, Charlotte!

12:09.410 --> 12:12.620
Don't be a fool! Choose a husband!

12:13.990 --> 12:16.540
You are the fool, Father!

12:16.540 --> 12:21.610
Why would you make me marry someone 
without asking for my opinion first?

12:21.610 --> 12:25.130
I don't even want to get married!

12:28.370 --> 12:33.010
In the end, nobody considered my feelings...

12:33.510 --> 12:34.970
Except for this man.

12:39.220 --> 12:44.410
You were the only one who asked 
for my opinion and respected it.

12:50.000 --> 12:51.260
I see.

12:52.380 --> 12:57.450
That's the reason you've decided not to 
marry and commit double-suicide with me?

13:00.510 --> 13:03.170
You said I smell.

13:04.580 --> 13:06.630
The girl has got a keen nose.

13:06.630 --> 13:08.450
M-Mr. Gomez?

13:08.450 --> 13:09.940
Wh-Wha...

13:14.140 --> 13:15.720
What?!

13:16.150 --> 13:17.600
<b>m 0 0 l 140 0 140 60 0 60</b>

13:16.150 --> 13:17.600
<b>Servant of the
Wrathful Dark Lord
Gomez has appeared!</b>

13:17.590 --> 13:23.440
I intended to acquire this kingdom by becoming 
its king, then offering it to the Dark Lord.

13:23.750 --> 13:27.860
I didn't think the princess 
would see through my disguise.

13:28.720 --> 13:30.950
Had you realized his true identity?

13:30.950 --> 13:33.370
N-No, not at all.

13:33.370 --> 13:35.630
I simply said he smells because he does.

13:36.020 --> 13:37.070
You heard her.

13:37.070 --> 13:37.990
Silence!

13:39.410 --> 13:42.120
Given the circumstances,
I no longer need the throne!

13:42.580 --> 13:46.930
I shall simply kill all of you!

13:47.580 --> 13:50.130
Hey, wake up!

13:50.130 --> 13:52.690
This is no time to fall unconscious!

13:51.300 --> 13:53.590
Protect the king!

13:55.780 --> 13:57.680
Stay out of this, small fry!

14:08.060 --> 14:09.500
Hey.

14:10.650 --> 14:12.540
Watch it!

14:14.870 --> 14:21.320
Fine. If you want to play 
so bad, I'll play with you!

14:22.210 --> 14:23.670
<b>m 0 0 l 85 0 85 52 0 52</b>

14:22.210 --> 14:23.670
<b>Tama (Temp)
Martial Artist
Lv. 14</b>

14:26.010 --> 14:29.670
Then I shall sing for you.

14:29.640 --> 14:31.470
<b>m 0 0 l 125 0 125 60 0 60</b>

14:29.640 --> 14:31.470
<b>Otto
Wandering Minstrel
Lv. 89</b>

14:30.120 --> 14:31.470
Your level is so high!

14:31.470 --> 14:35.200
Now fight, valiant hero!

14:34.970 --> 14:37.180
<b>m 0 0 l 125 0 125 55 0 55</b>

14:34.970 --> 14:37.180
<b>Otto played
“Song of the 
Nameless Warrior”!</b>

14:35.200 --> 14:37.190
A buff skill, huh? Appreciate it.

14:37.180 --> 14:38.480
<b>But nothing happened.</b>

14:38.480 --> 14:40.400
<b>But nothing happened.</b>

14:38.730 --> 14:40.410
It's just your newest song?!

14:40.400 --> 14:43.900
<b>Sensei is entranced by the new song.</b>

14:41.990 --> 14:43.900
Please, Sensei...

14:56.040 --> 14:57.830
Cat Kick!

15:02.710 --> 15:04.470
Cat Punch!

15:13.540 --> 15:15.640
Oh, I'm sorry. Did you just do something?

15:16.090 --> 15:18.170
<i>What's with those horns?</i>

15:18.170 --> 15:20.650
<i>On top of being crazy hard, 
they're sharp, too.</i>

15:21.290 --> 15:23.810
I'll put all my strength into my next attack.

15:23.810 --> 15:28.060
My Iron Horns will tear you to pieces.

15:31.090 --> 15:32.620
Hey, cow.

15:35.830 --> 15:42.080
Pardon the interruption,
but could you kill us first?

15:42.860 --> 15:43.930
Huh?

15:44.490 --> 15:45.710
Huh?

15:47.020 --> 15:50.590
She and I both wish to die.

15:51.070 --> 15:56.070
Could you kill us with those 
magnificent horns of yours?

15:57.760 --> 16:01.970
Now that the princess has been released 
from the grasp of her foolish father,

16:01.970 --> 16:07.010
her first wish is to commit 
double-suicide with me.

16:07.740 --> 16:12.000
Could you grant us this favor, cow?

16:12.350 --> 16:14.840
Wh-What an unbelievable man!

16:14.840 --> 16:16.420
What are you saying, Sensei?!

16:18.250 --> 16:19.600
Very well.

16:19.600 --> 16:25.670
If you're that desperate to die,
I shall grant your wish and kill you first.

16:26.090 --> 16:28.490
Then, I shall kill the king.

16:28.490 --> 16:33.970
Finally, I will burn the city to the ground,
 killing every last citizen of this kingdom.

16:34.580 --> 16:37.550
How does that sound?

16:37.890 --> 16:39.810
Do as you wish.

16:39.810 --> 16:44.280
Since we're about to die, 
it matters not to us.

16:48.390 --> 16:51.280
T-Traveler...

16:54.250 --> 16:58.160
Now our wish will be granted, Charlotte.

17:00.860 --> 17:04.890
Then enjoy the afterlife together!

17:05.950 --> 17:07.370
Sensei!

17:08.580 --> 17:10.050
Charlotte!

17:18.410 --> 17:19.550
No.

17:21.220 --> 17:22.850
I don't want to die.

17:25.100 --> 17:29.070
I can't die yet.

17:31.850 --> 17:33.540
I want to live...

17:36.660 --> 17:39.400
and protect the people of this kingdom!

17:43.150 --> 17:45.550
That's what you actually want?

17:47.380 --> 17:50.870
I knew you were a kind princess.

17:53.990 --> 17:56.590
As my partner for double-suicide...

18:00.660 --> 18:02.390
you simply will not do.

18:08.780 --> 18:09.970
Wait!

18:10.930 --> 18:12.860
Stout barrier of light.

18:12.860 --> 18:14.150
Shield!

18:17.320 --> 18:21.920
I will not let you die so
long as I am by your side.

18:21.660 --> 18:23.120
<b>m 0 0 l 70 0 70 55 0 55</b>

18:21.660 --> 18:23.120
<b>Annette
Priestess
Lv. 18</b>

18:30.530 --> 18:32.450
Nice work, Annette!

18:32.450 --> 18:33.260
Now, Tama!

18:33.770 --> 18:34.630
Got it!

18:35.750 --> 18:38.880
Wildcat Strike!

19:02.660 --> 19:09.170
You saved me. Th-Thanks, Annette.

19:10.430 --> 19:12.710
No, you saved me.

19:12.710 --> 19:15.120
Thank you, Tama.

19:15.120 --> 19:17.350
Wh-Who are you calling Tama?

19:21.060 --> 19:25.680
I shall turn your friendship into a song.

19:25.680 --> 19:27.550
We've had enough of you.

19:32.960 --> 19:34.570
Charlotte!

19:35.660 --> 19:37.550
I'm sorry!

19:37.550 --> 19:38.600
Father.

19:38.600 --> 19:43.070
I can't believe what I tried to do 
without considering your feelings.

19:43.810 --> 19:46.120
I'm not fit to be king.

19:46.120 --> 19:48.290
No, I'm not fit to be your father.

19:48.900 --> 19:52.930
Please forgive your foolish 
father, Charlotte.

19:52.930 --> 19:54.250
I'm begging you!

19:59.190 --> 20:00.530
Father.

20:02.690 --> 20:05.740
From now on, let me talk to you all about...

20:06.260 --> 20:09.630
this kingdom and us.

20:09.630 --> 20:12.600
Yes. Yes, of course.

20:23.660 --> 20:26.050
I failed to die again.

20:29.840 --> 20:31.450
I bring news!

20:31.750 --> 20:34.680
Monsters have appeared near the south gate!

20:35.140 --> 20:38.950
Then the royal guard will head there 
to exterminate them immediately.

20:42.380 --> 20:44.290
We are protecting the kingdom.

20:44.990 --> 20:47.500
I am counting on all of you.

20:47.500 --> 20:51.470
Yes, Your Majesty Queen Charlotte!

21:00.480 --> 21:03.190
A new 16-year-old queen, huh?

21:03.190 --> 21:06.520
Charlotte made quite the bold decision.

21:07.010 --> 21:10.000
I doubt it'll be easy.
I wonder if she'll be okay.

21:10.000 --> 21:12.740
It's the decision she made for herself.

21:13.300 --> 21:16.200
We have nothing to worry about.

21:24.700 --> 21:28.750
Anyway, dying women certainly are beautiful,

21:29.650 --> 21:35.180
but women who stand up on their own 
two feet are beautiful, as well.

21:35.180 --> 21:39.580
Whatever, Sensei. Could you 
walk on your own two feet?

21:42.840 --> 21:44.400
The sky is blue.

23:18.700 --> 23:19.860
Annette!

23:20.430 --> 23:22.650
Hang in there, Annette!

23:23.270 --> 23:27.340
Don't worry about me. Help him.

23:31.690 --> 23:34.010
Bring every healing potion we have!

23:34.010 --> 23:36.270
Summon every priest present!
